WEBVTT

00:00:00.690 --> 00:00:01.890
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>What</b> does he <b>do</b>?

00:00:02.234 --> 00:00:03.212
<v><b>B:</b></v> He’s a <b>nurse</b>.

00:00:03.525 --> 00:00:04.774
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>Where</b> does he <b>work</b>?

00:00:05.123 --> 00:00:06.502
<v><b>B:</b></v> He <b>works</b> in a <b>hospital</b>.

00:00:06.953 --> 00:00:08.846
<v><b>A:</b></v> Does he <b>speak English</b> at <b>work</b>?

00:00:09.197 --> 00:00:10.426
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, he <b>doesn’t</b>.

00:00:10.793 --> 00:00:12.153
<v><b>A:</b></v> Does he <b>like</b> his <b>job</b>?

00:00:12.527 --> 00:00:13.767
<v><b>B:</b></v> <b>Yes</b>, he <b>does</b>.